{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Retain the bundled plugins' minimum core requirement.** Both OTel plugin constructors call `requireSameThreadInvocationHooks()`, which rejects cores lacking the 2.2.2 lifecycle capability, including released 2.2.1. The unconditional older-core compatibility claim can therefore lead users to deploy a layer that fails during initialization. Qualify compatibility with that existing requirement and distinguish it from the String-only hook's linkage compatibility.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-6lHv","finding_digest":"1a512bdd4c63eab5036d1f50b47b6f72e9c5736cd1c9939d7f6396ba7e25ca20","finding_id":"arf_v1_djisxxkmmpvlka3nd5ili63pol","finding_key":"docs/advanced/propagation-metadata.md::plugin-contract-and-fallback::core-lifecycle-compatibility","identity_key":"docs/advanced/propagation-metadata.md::plugin-contract-and-fallback::core-lifecycle-compatibility","line":20,"observation_digest":"949ac572cff6b23b296fa4dff6b404fc1c88e18c9d0c44d068b6f4a15a44baa9","observation_id":"aro_v1_ssnmk4wp62zdwklputp7nnae7q","path":"docs/advanced/propagation-metadata.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T22:05:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_eawwrju76iotf6s6epkzao6daa","reviewed_base_sha":"f49beb68ba6c5d9970622d638fb15a2a38c63041","reviewed_head_sha":"7e7afaf48ce0a630d07e6f769b8222c2c4ae56c8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":18,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_t7aqtc7fs3y7fbl5tgicqi2jwg"},"pull_request":{"number":768},"record_id":"art_v1_bmojoyij74m3htrlr2vrezlk7s","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T22:05:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
